    "content": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span face=\"宋体\" style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">深证上〔</span><span face=\"宋体\" style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023〕</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span face=\"宋体\" style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">768</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span face=\"宋体\" style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">号</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span face=\"宋体\" style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">各市场参与人：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 23.6000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span face=\"宋体\" style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span face=\"宋体\" style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">落实中央政治局会议和国务院相关</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span face=\"宋体\" style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">会议</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span face=\"宋体\" style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">部署</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span face=\"宋体\" style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span face=\"宋体\" style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">进一步降低交易成本</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span face=\"宋体\" style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span face=\"宋体\" style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">激发市场活力</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span face=\"宋体\" style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，经研究决定，自</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; mso-bi